<title>UK: Brixton sells part of property site.</title>
<headline>Brixton sells part of property site.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Brixton Estate Plc said on Friday it has sold property investments to the Clerical Medical Investment Group Ltd for just over 17 million stg.</p>
<p>The part sold comprises ten units that have been let. Brixton will retain four development sites at the property.</p>
<p>Clerical Medical is a subsidiary of newly floated Halifax Plc.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 4019</p>
</text>
